Project License Notice
======================

This repository contains:
1) Build/tooling code in this repository (scripts, Makefile, styles, plist metadata).
2) Dictionary source data obtained from external providers.

The legal terms for (2) are not overridden by this repository.

Data License Summary (Important)
--------------------------------
The lexical data pipeline depends on Icelandic lexical resources distributed under
Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-NoDerivatives 4.0 International
(CC BY-NC-ND 4.0), including resources provided through CLARIN Iceland / Árnastofnun.

Under CC BY-NC-ND 4.0 in this context, you must treat generated dictionary bundles
as derivative outputs of the licensed data.

Practical compliance guidance:
- Allowed: local/private building and personal usage with attribution.
- Not allowed: redistributing modified source data.
- Not allowed: redistributing compiled dictionary bundles produced from ND data.
- Not allowed: commercial use where restricted by the source license.

You are responsible for verifying current terms at the original data source.
If source licensing changes, update this notice and your distribution behavior.

Morphology Data License (BÍN) — Required Verbatim Credit
--------------------------------------------------------
Inflected-form lookup and paradigm tables in this project are derived from
BÍN (Beygingarlýsing íslensks nútímamáls / Database of Icelandic
Morphology), https://bin.arnastofnun.is/. This is a separate dataset from
the CLARIN Iceland lexical sources above, with its own license: the
copyright holder is Stofnun Árna Magnússonar í íslenskum fræðum, and the
data are used under CC BY-SA 4.0 — NOT under the `islenska` package's MIT
terms, and not under the CC BY-NC-ND terms covering the ÍNO data.
(BÍN terms: https://bin.arnastofnun.is/DMII/LTdata/conditions/)

In accordance with the BÍN license terms, credit is hereby given as follows.
DO NOT EDIT, PARAPHRASE, TRANSLATE, ABBREVIATE, OR REFLOW the indented line
below — BÍN's terms require this exact wording:

    Beygingarlýsing íslensks nútímamáls. Stofnun Árna Magnússonar í íslenskum fræðum.
    Höfundur og ritstjóri Kristín Bjarnadóttir.

This credit line must be reproduced verbatim by anyone redistributing
anything built from BÍN data.

BÍN is accessed through the `islenska` (BinPackage) Python package,
Copyright © Miðeind ehf., original author Vilhjálmur Þorsteinsson. The
package code is MIT; the BÍN data it carries is not, and remains
CC BY-SA 4.0. Neither Miðeind ehf. nor this project claims any endorsement,
sponsorship, or official status granted by the BÍN copyright holder.

Note that BÍN's ShareAlike condition and ÍNO's NoDerivatives condition
cannot both be satisfied by a single redistributed artifact — which is one
more reason the compiled bundles from this project must stay local.

