Attribution Notes
-----------------
- Lexical source material is attributed to Stofnun Árna Magnússonar í íslenskum fræðum
  and/or the relevant CLARIN Iceland source records.
- Morphological enrichment is derived from BÍN, authored and edited by
  Kristín Bjarnadóttir, published by Stofnun Árna Magnússonar í íslenskum
  fræðum, licensed CC BY-SA 4.0 — see the required verbatim credit line
  above. Access is via the `islenska` package maintained by Miðeind ehf.,
  which is a delivery mechanism, not the source of the data or its license.
- Build orchestration, conversion, and packaging scripts in this repository are authored
  by repository contributors.

